# MOBILITY FLOW

Version 1.0

---

# Purpose

Mobility Flow is a continuous sequence of dynamic mobility exercises designed to improve joint mobility, movement quality, coordination and recovery while reinforcing efficient athletic movement patterns.

Within CAS, it is considered a foundational recovery and movement optimization protocol.

---

# Philosophy

Mobility is not passive flexibility.

It is the ability to actively control movement through a usable range of motion.

CAS integrates Mobility Flow to improve movement efficiency, maintain joint health and prepare athletes for long-term performance.

